cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Clio research kit"
abstract: >-
  A TypeScript toolkit that turns field and collection records into standards-shaped research packages
  (Darwin Core Archive, BagIt, RO-Crate, Frictionless Data Package), publishes field-lane schemas as JSON Schema,
  and imports CSV, JSON, NDJSON and exports from ODK Central and KoboToolbox. Pre-1.0 (version 0.1.0).
authors:
  - name: "RME Solutions Technology"
contact:
  - name: "Clio research kit maintainers"
    email: "security@cliomuseum.org"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-31"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/RME-Solutions-Technology/clio-research-kit"
